#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge-Really Bad Day' for a male character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You start drunk to the point of incapacitation, depressed, infected, "
"surrounded by fire, naked, and sick with the flu.  This day went downhill "
"really fast."
msgstr ""
"Du beginnst betrunken bis zum Punkt der Untauglichkeit, deprimiert, "
"infiziert, vom Feuer unzingelt, nackt und krank von der Grippe. Dieser Tag "
"ging wirklich schnell den Bach herunter."

