#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge-Medieval Peasant' for a male
#. character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Som nigromancie hath brought yow hidder!  Ye have only the hoose on youre "
"legges and the knyf at youre syde and youre prayeres to Marie moder of God."
msgstr ""
"So eene dunkle Zaubrkunscht hett dich herbrocht! Du hescht nur d Hoos on dei"
" Beine, d Messer a deine Sitt und dei Gebete a di heilig Maria vo Gott."

