#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You tiredly rub your eyes."
msgstr "Müde reibst du deine Augen."

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You let out a small yawn."
msgstr "Du gähnst ein wenig."

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You stretch your back."
